Port 22
Protocol 2

# Weak: root login + password auth (brute-force / recon target)
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no

# No throttling
MaxAuthTries 100
MaxSessions 20
LoginGraceTime 120

LogLevel VERBOSE
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding yes
PrintMotd no

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
